{
"file": 349,
"paths": [
"d008/d006/f020"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "106ef1eb",
"en_raw": "Part-time help wanted?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "0d588c2b",
"en_raw": "Which means..."
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "8dbaa9eb",
"en_raw": "there's a chance"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "d9fa572a",
"en_raw": "the shop will open?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "be9ed1a6",
"en_raw": "...Still, what a low hourly wage"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "a3b7eee8",
"en_raw": "Excuse me, um..."
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "565670b8",
"en_raw": "this pachinko parlor"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "53c62672",
"en_raw": "Oh dear, we were just"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "d4482961",
"en_raw": "talking about that"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "7eb2b7d0",
"en_raw": "Honestly, when will it"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "d43d139c",
"en_raw": "open again?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "a9e0052f",
"en_raw": "Can't even kill time"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "1e405684",
"en_raw": "It won't open again, surely"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "3c94f692",
"en_raw": "There was a lot of trouble here..."
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "1e3b3693",
"en_raw": "Good for saving money, no?"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "ae40ef89",
"en_raw": "That's true"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "36c4b70b",
"en_raw": "Excuse me~"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "c33368e1",
"en_raw": "Oh dear"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "4a4a92c8",
"en_raw": "That's right..."
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "9488b64d",
"en_raw": "She isn't listening at all"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "e2f98045",
"en_raw": "It's about the pachinko parlor"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "85e2e2d6",
"en_raw": "Do you know the manager?"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "38b62895",
"en_raw": "Of course I know him"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "2d47ae80",
"en_raw": "He's famous around here"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "dcbdd92e",
"en_raw": "He's unbelievably"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "9eb445e4",
"en_raw": "stingy"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "e715e029",
"en_raw": "At the last grand opening"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "6336dca8",
"en_raw": "I put in 50,000 yen"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "ca7dc4e7",
"en_raw": "and got no reaction at all"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "9cbc4c15",
"en_raw": "What does he think customers are?"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "5087ce32",
"en_raw": "All the money he made went to"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "2e3d8de2",
"en_raw": "horses, clothes, cars..."
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "b6211540",
"en_raw": "Right, and he never"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "0cadcae9",
"en_raw": "spent a cent on women"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "370ad45e",
"en_raw": "And that wife of his"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "72bb58f9",
"en_raw": "if she was going to kill herself"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "217832be",
"en_raw": "she should've cut it off"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "0f1592d8",
"en_raw": "Oh, you're bold today"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "d2fe8012",
"en_raw": "You were pretty flattered"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "ec7154c0",
"en_raw": "when he eyed you before, weren't you?"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "4513f801",
"en_raw": "Don't say weird things"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "89da7704",
"en_raw": "No way, a man like that"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "8f025ac5",
"en_raw": "Well, but with the shop like this now"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "70626758",
"en_raw": "serves him right"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "91b7dc1c",
"en_raw": "But he was inside, the manager"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "bf243992",
"en_raw": "With that personality, he's probably"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "ef024802",
"en_raw": "plotting something again"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "18095591",
"en_raw": "What a shameless man..."
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "00e05339",
"en_raw": "I can't get a word in..."
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "589f265e",
"en_raw": "It's like the Toilet Gang"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "66281620",
"en_raw": "twenty years from now"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "9409cd0a",
"en_raw": "...Women, you know"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "4cc349db",
"en_raw": "have it rough"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "4463e3dd",
"en_raw": "That was very educational"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "aa50da1c",
"en_raw": "...Oh, that's tough"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "d5ef70a1",
"en_raw": "...Over here?"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "c7ecb3f1",
"en_raw": "I'm in top form over here"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "83c4f87f",
"en_raw": "Jingle-jangle..."
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "0e87675e",
"en_raw": "Excuse me"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "e2f98045",
"en_raw": "It's about the pachinko parlor"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "93cb6b7a",
"en_raw": "Do you know the manager?"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "f02bd368",
"en_raw": "Know him? Well..."
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "65ecf68c",
"en_raw": "I'm his old horse-racing buddy"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "ffe68066",
"en_raw": "You know him too?"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "ff2bcc46",
"en_raw": "Odd people know each other"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "608d82f9",
"en_raw": "That guy too..."
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "b51dd6ef",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "4df2369b",
"en_raw": "But lately I heard"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "f1ef3250",
"en_raw": "the manager killed himself"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "028d5f96",
"en_raw": "Hey, don't kill him off"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "f1b4d638",
"en_raw": "That guy isn't"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "27673cef",
"en_raw": "the suicide type"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "185483c8",
"en_raw": "Well, I mean, um..."
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "2e308f35",
"en_raw": "Since that incident"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "7cc563d6",
"en_raw": "he's changed a bit, though"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "e639706a",
"en_raw": "...What incident?"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "5cd269ab",
"en_raw": "...He changed after that incident?"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "95bb58c3",
"en_raw": "Even to"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "99d060e2",
"en_raw": "a spiky blond guy?"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "e8c16899",
"en_raw": "My hairstyle's got nothing to do with it"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "98a98456",
"en_raw": "Besides, this isn't something"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "0906f0c4",
"en_raw": "to tell a kid"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "013ab858",
"en_raw": "Oh, cheapskate"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "202618f1",
"en_raw": "...Well, anyway"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "5fc545f9",
"en_raw": "If you see the manager"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "cfe52a6f",
"en_raw": "invite him to"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "9bcc70f1",
"en_raw": "go see the horses"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "989b117d",
"en_raw": "If you see the manager"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "cfe52a6f",
"en_raw": "invite him to"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "9bcc70f1",
"en_raw": "go see the horses"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "a0c00b69",
"en_raw": "Thanks a lot"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "67e1353a",
"en_raw": "Sure thing"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "7d4e0059",
"en_raw": "I knew it..."
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "1c530a82",
"en_raw": "Don't get in the way"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "3203ffc5",
"en_raw": "Wait until you're older"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "12232be8",
"en_raw": "Come to the shop in three years"
}
]
}